## Transporte HTTP/1.1 de portus sobre `poll(2)` y llhttp.
##
## Envuelve las estructuras opacas del binding (`portus.native`) en dos runes
## prestados, `Request` y `Response`, y expone `serve`, que bloquea hasta que el
## proceso muere o el socket no se puede abrir.
##
## Un `Request` y un `Response` **solo son válidos durante la llamada al
## handler**: apuntan a memoria de la conexión y el bucle los reutiliza en la
## petición siguiente. Si necesitas conservar algo, cópialo (`copy` del string).
##
## No hace TLS, HTTP/2, ni atiende dos conexiones a la vez: un handler que se
## bloquea bloquea a todos. Para escalar, varios procesos (F7).
##
## ## Memoria
## Los `string` que devuelven los accesores son propios del llamador: libéralos
## con `banish` cuando ya no los necesites.

import portus.native as native

## Copia `count` bytes del transporte a un `string` propio del llamador.
antiquus _take_bytes with data as ref to frozen char, count as int into string:
    """
    return pengu_string_from_cstr_len(data, count);
    """

## Copia una cadena C terminada en cero a un `string` propio.
antiquus _take_cstr with data as ref to frozen char into string:
    """
    return pengu_string_from_cstr(data);
    """

## Petición HTTP en curso.
##
## Es una vista prestada: no la guardes más allá del handler.
rune Request:
    _raw as ref to native.portus_request_t

enchanting Request:
    ## Devuelve el método (`GET`, `POST`, …), en mayúsculas.
    ##
    ## ## Memoria
    ## El `string` es propio del llamador.
    weave method into string:
        var count as int is 0
        let data as ref to frozen char is calling native.portus_native_request_method_name with self->_raw, sigil of count
        return calling _take_bytes with data, count

    ## Devuelve la ruta sin query (`/users/7`).
    ##
    ## ## Memoria
    ## El `string` es propio del llamador.
    weave path into string:
        var count as int is 0
        let data as ref to frozen char is calling native.portus_native_request_path with self->_raw, sigil of count
        return calling _take_bytes with data, count

    ## Devuelve la query sin el `?` (puede ser vacía).
    ##
    ## ## Memoria
    ## El `string` es propio del llamador.
    weave query into string:
        var count as int is 0
        let data as ref to frozen char is calling native.portus_native_request_query with self->_raw, sigil of count
        return calling _take_bytes with data, count

    ## Devuelve el cuerpo tal cual llegó, como texto.
    ##
    ## ## Memoria
    ## El `string` es propio del llamador.
    weave body_text into string:
        var count as int is 0
        let data as ref to frozen char is calling native.portus_native_request_body with self->_raw, sigil of count
        if count <= 0:
            return ""
        return calling _take_bytes with data, count

    ## Número de cabeceras recibidas.
    weave header_count into int:
        return calling native.portus_native_request_header_count with self->_raw

    ## Nombre de la cabecera `index` (0-based).
    ##
    ## ## Memoria
    ## El `string` es propio del llamador.
    weave header_name with index as int into string:
        var count as int is 0
        let data as ref to frozen char is calling native.portus_native_request_header_name with self->_raw, index, sigil of count
        return calling _take_bytes with data, count

    ## Valor de la cabecera `index` (0-based).
    ##
    ## ## Memoria
    ## El `string` es propio del llamador.
    weave header_value with index as int into string:
        var count as int is 0
        let data as ref to frozen char is calling native.portus_native_request_header_value with self->_raw, index, sigil of count
        return calling _take_bytes with data, count

    ## `true` si la conexión puede reutilizarse.
    weave keep_alive into bool:
        return (calling native.portus_native_request_keep_alive with self->_raw) != 0

    ## Minor de la versión HTTP (0 para HTTP/1.0, 1 para HTTP/1.1).
    weave http_minor into int:
        return calling native.portus_native_request_http_minor with self->_raw

    ## 0 si la petición cabe en los límites, 1 si el cuerpo era enorme, 2 si
    ## lo eran las cabeceras.
    weave oversized into int:
        return calling native.portus_native_request_is_oversized with self->_raw

## Respuesta HTTP en construcción.
##
## Los bytes se acumulan en la conexión; nada se envía hasta que el handler
## termina. Llama a `mark_sent` cuando hayas decidido la respuesta: si el
## handler vuelve sin marcarla, el transporte responde 500.
rune Response:
    _raw as ref to native.portus_response_t
    _sent as bool

enchanting Response:
    ## Fija el código de estado.
    weave set_status with status as int into void:
        calling native.portus_native_response_set_status with self->_raw, status

    ## Fija (o reemplaza) una cabecera.
    weave set_header with name as string, value as string into void:
        calling native.portus_native_response_header_bytes with self->_raw, bytes of name, name length, bytes of value, value length

    ## Añade bytes al cuerpo.
    weave write_bytes with data as ref to frozen byte, count as int into void:
        calling native.portus_native_response_write_bytes with self->_raw, data, count

    ## Añade texto al cuerpo.
    weave write_text with text as string into void:
        calling native.portus_native_response_write_bytes with self->_raw, bytes of text, text length

    ## Marca la respuesta como enviada.
    weave mark_sent into void:
        set self->_sent is true
        calling native.portus_native_response_mark_sent with self->_raw

    ## Código de estado actual.
    ## Empieza una respuesta en streaming con `content_type`.
    weave stream_begin with content_type as string into bool:
        var ok as int is calling native.portus_native_response_stream_begin with self->_raw, (bytes of content_type), content_type.len
        return ok == 0

    ## Escribe un trozo de texto en la respuesta en streaming.
    weave stream_write_text with text as string into bool:
        var ok as int is calling native.portus_native_response_stream_write with self->_raw, (bytes of text), text.len
        return ok == 0

    ## Cierra la respuesta en streaming.
    weave stream_end into bool:
        var ok as int is calling native.portus_native_response_stream_end with self->_raw
        return ok == 0

    weave status into int:
        return calling native.portus_native_response_status with self->_raw

    ## ¿El handler ya llamó a `mark_sent`?
    weave is_sent into bool:
        return self->_sent

## Opciones de arranque del servidor.
rune ServeOptions:
    host as string
    port as int
    max_connections as int
    max_header_bytes as int
    max_body_bytes as int
    idle_timeout_ms as int
    keep_alive as bool

## Opciones por defecto: `127.0.0.1:3000`, 1024 conexiones, 16 KiB de cabeceras,
## 1 MiB de cuerpo, 60 s de inactividad y keep-alive.
weave base_options into ServeOptions:
    return with host is "127.0.0.1", port is 3000, max_connections is 1024, max_header_bytes is 16384, max_body_bytes is 1048576, idle_timeout_ms is 60000, keep_alive is true

## Estado que el bucle C pasa de vuelta al handler puente.
rune _Bridge:
    handler as weave with request as ref to Request, response as ref to Response into void

## Puente C → PenguScript: convierte los punteros opacos en runes prestados.
weave _bridge with userdata as ref to void, request as ref to void, response as ref to void into void:
    let state as ref to _Bridge is transmute userdata to ref to _Bridge
    var req as Request is with _raw is transmute request to ref to native.portus_request_t
    var res as Response is with _raw is transmute response to ref to native.portus_response_t, _sent is false
    calling state->handler with sigil of req, sigil of res

## Arranca el servidor y bloquea hasta que muere.
##
## Devuelve el puerto real cuando `options.port` es 0 (puerto efímero): útil en
## tests. En error devuelve el texto de `portus_last_error`.
##
## ## Memoria
## `options.host` se presta durante la llamada; el resultado está vacío en éxito.
weave serve_loop with options as ServeOptions, handler as weave with request as ref to Request, response as ref to Response into void into result of int to string:
    var bridge as _Bridge is with handler is handler
    var bound as int is 0
    # `if ... then ... else ...` en posición de valor: la forma multilínea con
    # dos puntos compila a la rama `else` (bug del compilador, ver
    # scratch/portus-compiler-fixes.md). Con `then`/`else` es una expresión.
    let keep as int is if options.keep_alive then 1 else 0
    let rc as int is calling native.portus_native_serve with bytes of options.host, options.port, options.max_connections, options.max_header_bytes, options.max_body_bytes, options.idle_timeout_ms, keep, _bridge, sigil of bridge, sigil of bound
    if rc != 0:
        let message as string is calling _take_cstr with calling native.portus_native_last_error
        return calling err_of with message
    return calling ok_of with bound

## Puente para handlers que necesitan un `data` propio (la aplicación).
rune _BridgeData:
    handler as weave with data as ref to void, request as ref to Request, response as ref to Response into void
    data as ref to void

## Puente C → PenguScript con `data`: lo usa el despachador.
weave _bridge_data with userdata as ref to void, request as ref to void, response as ref to void into void:
    let state as ref to _BridgeData is transmute userdata to ref to _BridgeData
    var req as Request is with _raw is transmute request to ref to native.portus_request_t
    var res as Response is with _raw is transmute response to ref to native.portus_response_t, _sent is false
    calling state->handler with state->data, sigil of req, sigil of res

## Igual que `serve_loop`, pero el handler recibe un `data` opaco.
##
## ## Memoria
## `data` debe seguir vivo mientras el servidor corre (el bucle bloquea).
weave serve_loop_data with options as ServeOptions, handler as weave with data as ref to void, request as ref to Request, response as ref to Response into void, data as ref to void into result of int to string:
    var bridge as _BridgeData is with handler is handler, data is data
    var bound as int is 0
    let keep as int is if options.keep_alive then 1 else 0
    let rc as int is calling native.portus_native_serve with bytes of options.host, options.port, options.max_connections, options.max_header_bytes, options.max_body_bytes, options.idle_timeout_ms, keep, _bridge_data, sigil of bridge, sigil of bound
    if rc != 0:
        let message as string is calling _take_cstr with calling native.portus_native_last_error
        return calling err_of with message
    return calling ok_of with bound

## Versión de la capa nativa (ping de humo del binding).
weave native_ping with n as int into int:
    return calling native.portus_native_ping with n
